# Firewall backend.
#
# The kernel is built nftables-only (see profiles/pc/kernel/config-fragment:
# the legacy xtables core behind CONFIG_NETFILTER_XTABLES_LEGACY is off, so
# ip_tables.ko does not exist). USE=nftables makes net-firewall/iptables ship
# xtables-nft-multi, which is what lets docker and libvirt keep issuing
# iptables commands against an nft-only kernel.
#
# Pair this with: eselect iptables set xtables-nft-multi
# Without it the iptables symlink stays on xtables-legacy-multi and docker
# dies at startup with "Module ip_tables not found".
net-firewall/iptables nftables
